{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/privacy/layout,_N_T_/privacy/page,_N_T_/privacy"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--JlqRGlKo7do21zOSFmcbS--><html lang=\"en\" class=\"__variable_c22fe1 __variable_538739 __variable_d758cf\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/98dcc76020b66359.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5f5800d9065ac0b9.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-ec67ac596534aad8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-59d88098b2f06625.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-5d5a01259796646a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/44530001-6233f3575f72737f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/370-292ac9f8446dbc14.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-e859473b1b759a0a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/534-9126c6f48a0c58b7.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/not-found-5e2d368b27fed647.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Privacy Policy | Refly</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn how Refly collects, uses, and protects your personal information.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"premium mens jeans india,luxury cargo pants,mens formal pants india,refly clothing,premium bottom wear india\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Refly — Move Different.\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Premium men&#x27;s bottom wear. Luxury quality, delivered across India.\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_IN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://refly5428.builtwithrocket.new/assets/images/6391F31B-6325-43A2-8883-0AEF80565846-1785440876904.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Refly — Premium Men&#x27;s Bottom Wear\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Refly — Move Different.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Premium men&#x27;s bottom wear. Luxury quality, delivered across India.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://refly5428.builtwithrocket.new/assets/images/6391F31B-6325-43A2-8883-0AEF80565846-1785440876904.png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Refly — Premium Men&#x27;s Bottom Wear\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.cdnfonts.com/css/blue-fonte-sans\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__className_538739\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-3\">Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"text-gray-500 mb-10\">Last Updated: August 3, 2026</p><p class=\"mb-8 text-gray-700 leading-8\">At <strong>Refly</strong>, your privacy matters to us. We are committed to protecting your personal information and being transparent about how we collect, use, and safeguard it. By using our website, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.</p><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">1. Information We Collect</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">When you place an order or interact with our website, we may collect your name, email address, phone number, shipping and billing address, and payment-related information. We may also collect basic device and browsing information through cookies to improve your shopping experience.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">2. How We Use Your Information</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">We use your information to process orders, deliver products, provide customer support, send order updates, improve our website, prevent fraud, and share promotional offers (only if you choose to receive them).</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">3. Payment Security</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">All online payments are securely processed through trusted payment partners. Refly does not store your debit card, credit card, or UPI credentials on our servers.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">4. Cookies</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">We use cookies to remember your preferences, improve website performance, analyze visitor behavior, and provide a smoother shopping experience.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">5. Sharing Your Information</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">We never sell your personal information. Your data may only be shared with trusted logistics partners, payment providers, and service providers necessary to complete your order or operate our business.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">6. Data Security</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">7. Your Rights</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information by contacting us. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe, subject to applicable laws.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">8. Changes to This Policy</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">Refly may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be published on this page with the updated revision date.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">9. Contact Us</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700\"><p><strong>Refly</strong></p><p>Email: support@refly.store</p><p>Phone: +91 7760775622</p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><div class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-[10000] flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-sm w-full pointer-events-none\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5f5800d9065ac0b9.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[5380,[\\\"730\\\",\\\"static/chunks/44530001-6233f3575f72737f.js\\\",\\\"370\\\",\\\"static/chunks/370-292ac9f8446dbc14.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-e859473b1b759a0a.js\\\"],\\\"AuthProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[7740,[\\\"730\\\",\\\"static/chunks/44530001-6233f3575f72737f.js\\\",\\\"370\\\",\\\"static/chunks/370-292ac9f8446dbc14.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-e859473b1b759a0a.js\\\"],\\\"CartProvider\\\"]\\n4:I[1559,[\\\"730\\\",\\\"static/chunks/44530001-6233f3575f72737f.js\\\",\\\"370\\\",\\\"static/chunks/370-292ac9f8446dbc14.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-e859473b1b759a0a.js\\\"],\\\"ToastProvider\\\"]\\n5:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[3486,[\\\"534\\\",\\\"static/chunks/534-9126c6f48a0c58b7.js\\\",\\\"345\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/not-found-5e2d368b27fed647.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nd:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/98dcc76020b66359.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"JlqRGlKo7do21zOSFmcbS\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\